  "title": "Bailey J Probable NDE 7112",
  "date": "January 2012",
  "content": "After several days of extremely high fever (104+) my body was shutting down. I had scarlet fever. At one point, I was lying in bed, burning from the inside, my skin painful to the touch. I suddenly felt all of the pain slip away, just a floating, calm, sense of awareness. My thoughts were no longer sluggish. There was a level of calmness and clarity that I had never experienced before. I felt so peaceful, so relieved. There was no fear at all. I remember thinking, 'So this is what it feels like to die'. I felt like I had a choice. I could sink back into my body, or I could gently float away into the peace. The only thing that brought me back was thinking that I would be leaving my young son without a mother. I reluctantly chose to live. I am no longer afraid of death. It is the most peaceful and natural thing in the world.",
